CounterBookingRequest.description:
`POST /admin/counter/bookings`: book and settle in one step.

`paid` = the whole total taken now (cash, UPI or bank), confirmed at once with a receipt;
`deposit` = the quote's deposit taken now, the balance due later as on the website.

TravellerDetailsInput.description:
`PUT /account/bookings/{ref}/travellers/{id}/details`. A partial save is fine — `missing`
says what is left. `id_number` blank keeps the saved number (it is never sent back);
`id_type` null removes the ID.
